                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In balloting in two meetings on November 3 (GA (III/1), <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Plenary</hi>, pages 378–380) the General Assembly elected the following
                    jurists to the International Law Commission: Messrs. Shu-shi Hsu, Amado, Rau,
                    Brierly, Scelle, Cordoba, Hudson, François, Koretsky, Spyropoulos, Alfaro,
                    Yepes, Khouri, Zourek and Sandström.</p>
            </div>
